# Bolt.new Knowledge / Instruction Points — Cubastion Nexus

## Product Knowledge

* This product is a multi-tenant enterprise support portal
* Built for Cubastion Consulting
* Japanese enterprise customers will use this platform
* Customers raise and track support tickets
* Agents manage and resolve tickets
* Admins manage organizations, users, SLA, and audit logs
* Similar to Zendesk/Freshdesk but customized for Cubastion

---

# UI/UX Knowledge

## Overall UI Feel

The UI must feel:

* Premium SaaS
* Enterprise-grade
* Calm
* Professional
* Japanese-corporate friendly
* Clean and spacious
* Trustworthy
* Minimal but modern

DO NOT:

* Create startup flashy UI
* Use gaming styles
* Use neon colors
* Use dark mode
* Use excessive gradients
* Use heavy animations

---

# Branding Knowledge

## Primary Brand Color

Teal:
#01516A

## Accent Color

Orange:
#F9A41E

## Neutral Colors

* Grey: #999999
* Light Grey: #EBEBEB
* Dark Grey: #707070
* White: #FFFFFF

## Important Branding Rules

* Teal is the dominant UI color
* Orange is only for highlights/warnings
* White and light grey should dominate surfaces
* No black backgrounds
* Use soft enterprise shadows
* Use soft borders

