# Layout Knowledge

## Application Layout

* Left sidebar navigation
* Top header
* Spacious content area
* Dashboard/card-based structure

## Sidebar

* Dark teal background
* Minimal icons
* Professional spacing
* Active state highlighted in teal
* Collapsible on mobile

## Header

* White background
* Minimal border/shadow
* Search bar
* Notification icon
* User profile menu

